 ## How it works
 **Inputs:**
-- Volume density field (implicit or explicit).
-- Light source geometry (area definition).
-- Point $\mathbf{p}$ to shade.
-- Number of samples $N$ for the light source area.
+*   Point $\mathbf{p}$ in the volume or on the surface.
